っちゃ面白かったw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のために誰かのために（みさみさ、ちーちゃん、ひめたん、らりん、とまと/まりちゃ、かわたん、ゆったん、みなみ、中田）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌、頑張って練習しましたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/03/2025589/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCでいろいろ言いましたが\n中田の髪型は巻きツインテール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんてーる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"痛いですね恥ずかしかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/03/2025589/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装は\n8th制服と生まれたままで衣装\nあとは\nでこぴんと偶然だけ衣装があった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/03/2025589/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユニットは\n曲前にオリメンからの音声コメントが流れたよ！\nみんな協力ありがとう＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜メンバーたちも見に来てくれてたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/03/2025589/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/03/2025589/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんが写メ送ってくれた(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しいライブだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n4